{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Fighting the Competition"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Asking for an Extension"}, {"type": "position", "content": 11}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 9}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use important information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le09ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Language for Opinions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Remember that in Business world, it is common to give your opinion about things."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Review some of the ways in which you can ask and give opinions:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Giving Opinions</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I believe ...<br/> I reckon ...<br/> As far as I know, ...<br/> If you ask me, ...<br/> Personally, ...<br/> To my mind, ...<br/> The way I see it, ...<br/> To be honest / frank ...<br/> I am confident that ...<br/>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">I am confident that</span> your reputation offers a competitive edge."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">As you know,</span> we need to carry out some market research."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Personally,</span> I look forward to showing you our results."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking About Future Actions, Plans, and Intentions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Remember when we know about the future, the <span class=\"strong\">Present</span> tense is used:<br/> <ul><li>The <span class=\"italic\">Present Simple</span> is used for things that are <span class=\"italic\">arranged</span> and <span class=\"italic\">scheduled</span>.</li> <li>The <span class=\"italic\">Present Continuous</span> is used for <span class=\"italic\">plans</span> or <span class=\"italic\">arrangements</span>.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "When we don't know much about the future, \u201c<span class=\"strong italic\">Will</span>\u201d is used: <ul><li>to make predictions</li> <li>for voluntary actions, actions you \u201cwant to\u201d or \u201care willing to\u201d to do</li> <li>to make offers and promises</li> <li>to talk about offers and promises we can also use \u201cwill\u201d</li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>\u201c<span class=\"italic\">(be) going to</span>\u201d is used to talk about plans and intentions:<br/> <span class=\"italic\">I'm going to draw up something they can't refuse.</span></li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "It is important to remember that both \u201cwill\u201d and \u201cbe going to\u201d refer to a specific time in the future. The chart below summarizes the two structures."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Be going to</span>  [subject + be going to + verb]\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Will</span> [subject + will + verb]\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>to express a plan</li> <li>to express a prediction</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>to express a promise</li> <li>to express a voluntary action</li> <li>to express a prediction</li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I <span class=\"strong\">will reschedule</span> our meeting for next week."}, {"type": "example", "content": "We <span class=\"strong\">are going to obtain</span> the same results."}, {"type": "example", "content": " It <span class=\"strong\">will be</span> a great opportunity for us."}, {"type": "example", "content": "This <span class=\"strong\">will give</span> us enough time to finish the project."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "partnership"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the state of working closely with another company"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We are very excited with this partnership, Mr. Farmani."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le09ob11aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are the words to review."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "extensive"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "large in amount"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This requires extensive research."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le09ob11aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "personalized"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "refers to something that is designed or changed so that it is suitable for a particular company"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Your agency has a reputation for the personalized services it provides."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le09ob11aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "advantageous"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "creating favorable conditions that increase the chances of success"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It will be greatly advantageous if we can have until the end of the week."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le09ob11aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "a competitive edge"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an advantage that a company has over its compe