ect!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le09ob11re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le09ob11re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn6le09ob11re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "0", "image": "engenn6le09ob11re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Janet! A pleasure to meet you in person. How do you do?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Very well, thank you,  Mr. Farmani, the pleasure is mine.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Please have a seat, Janet. I am looking forward to discussing your proposal.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Thank you. We are very excited with this partnership, Mr. Farmani. The way I see it, expanding into a new cultural market requires extensive research. We are going to obtain the same success in Latin America as we are used to achieving elsewhere."}, {"time": "32000", "image": "engenn6le09ob11re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Your agency has a reputation for its personalized service.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: True. The potential here is too great to lose through carelessness. While we will proceed immediately, we need to be thorough in our research. I would like to ask for an extension on the proposal deadline.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: How much of an extension do you need?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: I believe it'll be greatly advantageous if we can have until the end of this week. I reckon this is going to give us what we need to draw up a proposal you can't refuse."}, {"time": "65000", "image": "engenn6le09ob11re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: A four-day extension then. I am confident in your reputation and know your competitive edge. Personally, I don't believe you would ask for an extension without excellent reason. I will reschedule a meeting for Friday.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Thank you. I look forward to presenting you with excellent results on Friday. Have a good day.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Good day to you too."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "audio", "value": "x"}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "text", "id": 2, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}]}